 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? It can be, especially at night or during bad weather. It' not as safe as it could be. You can use a bunny hot water bottle, or a small electric one on low. Fill it with hot water from a real hot tap. That's the safest bet. Buses often stop completely, and at the end of day they're cold too. At this time of year a mid range tread and a decent amount of tread life still on them is what you' looking for. They' last much longer than someone just starting out and save you buying new one every few months.",
